L000762	In Fourier space, we have $\boldsymbol{\tilde{u}}(\boldsymbol{k})=-{k}^{2}\boldsymbol{\tilde{b}}(\boldsymbol{k})$, with $\boldsymbol{\tilde{b}} \left( \boldsymbol{k}, t \right)
L000763	=
L000764	\left( 1 / 2 \pi \right)
