L000863	(b) Incompressible kinetic energy spectrum $E_i(k)$ as a function of $k$ for the same $N_g$.
L000864	Both panels correspond to a quench time of $\tau_Q = 60$, evaluated at the equilibration time.
L000865	For this analysis, a single realization was selected from the $1000$ independent noise realizations to determine the optimal $N_g$.
L000866	Each $N_g$ is chosen according to $N_g = 2 \lfloor L k_m / 2 \pi \rceil + 1$, with $k_m = 100$, $200$, $400$, and $600$.
L000867	}
